    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Kay appears to be fighting the air... Um, this could be a case of poison-induced hallucination.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh! Shit! I forgot to warn you! There's a hell of a lot of mushrooms and fruits growing wild along the road here, and more than most of them you can't eat. If you do, you end up like that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forgot the kid was even wilder than me. I bet she snuck off while we were busy talking and helped herself to the buffet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, damn it. Okay. Go tie her up and take her back with you, Lancet-2. She'll be fine after a while, probably.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave it to me~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, one last friendly reminder. Our surroundings are quite hot, but such environments are prone to drastic nighttime temperature swings. Please bring the necessary supplies with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lancet-2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_285_medic2_1",
        "name2": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, nice catch. Doctor, Tomimi, you two make sure you grab what you need from the aircraft.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's a long way to the Temple from here, and the rainforest won't have anywhere decent to sleep. Get ready to spend the night in the open.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
